e ground it slowly comes to a stop  right on top of a drop of blood from the  injured researcher the orb begins to  shudder both of the scientists look in  shock as it rolls along the floor  banging into the containment chamber  walls as if it was looking for a way out  the researchers jump to their feet and  run after the oar one of the scientists  grab the orb off the ground and holds it  tightly in both hands suddenly a hole  appears in the orb surface the  researcher looks at one another their  eyes wide in terror the researcher  holding the orb puts his hand over the  hole to cover it he instantly recoils in  pain as something stabs him from within  a metallic tentacle appears through the  hole in the orb followed by a creature  with a squid-like body the creature  remains motionless sensing the room  around him the scientist not holding the  orb races towards the storage closet to  find something to cover the hole with  the other researcher remains motionless  hoping that the creature will just go  back into its container without warning  the creature launches itself at the  faceplate of the researcher holding the  oar it smashes through the protective  shielding and enters the mouth of the  researcher the other scientist screams  in terror he runs out of the containment  chamber and slams down the button to  activate the failsafe to prevent a  containment breach the room begins to  fill with mist and triflic acid alarms  sound in the lab other scp personnel  come rushing in they watch in horror as  the head of the researcher with scp-1124  inside of him starts to expand blood  begins to pour out of his nose eyes and  ears then with a gruesome pop the  researcher's head explodes the  researchers leaned closer to the window  to get a better look at what's happening  they scan the room when suddenly an  instance of scp-1124 slams into the  observation glass the researchers jump  back in surprise a crack runs the length  of the observation window at the same  time the alarms are going off in the  research lab different alarms sound deep  within the facility sensors have picked  up a huge jump in thermal energy in the  reptilian creature's chamber along with  the movement of its tail and limbs armed  scp foundation agents run towards the  containment chamber but when they are  only a few feet away the blast door is  forced off its hinges and slams against  the far wall of the complex the  containment team screeches to a halt as  scp-682 slowly lumbers out of its cell  and shakes its body the creature locks  eyes with the agents who are frozen in  shock it curls back its lips to reveal  razor sharp teeth saliva falls to the  floor open fire one of the agents yells  they fire a barrage of bullets at  scp-682  but they seem to have no effect the  creature stalks towards the agents and  uses its claws and teeth to tear them  apart  scp-682 runs through the facility  killing every living thing in its path  it bursts out into the sunlight where it  sniffs the air it then sprints towards  the high density fence and bursts  through it as if it was nothing more  than cobwebs  scp-682 runs in the direction of the  crashed elena rocket a battalion of  agents is deployed to stop scp-682  but the monster quickly destroys anyone  and anything in its path it seems to be  on a mission and nothing will stop it  when scp-682 reaches the rocket it  consumes the entire research team that  is there examining the spacecraft it  then begins sniffing around the area and  climbs into the cargo hold it's looking  for something mobile task force iota 5  approaches the rocket in two teams the  first is on the ground in armored  vehicles the second is in a helicopter  they have a plan it seems that scp-682  is looking for the orbs that were inside  the rocket for some reason they are  incredibly important to scp-682  and it will stop at nothing to find them  scp-682 is acting like a mother  searching for a lost child mobile task  force iota 5 has brought one of the  scp-1120 orbs with them in hopes they  can lure scp-682 back to its containment  chamber when the first team approaches  in the chopper  scp-682 stops its search the creature  sniffs the air and spots the helicopter  oh i think he spotted us says the pilot  the ground force opens fire on scp-682  the creature does not seem interested in  them instead  scp-682 remains fixated on the  helicopter as if it knows there is an  orb on board the creature leaps off the  rocket and begins running towards the  helicopter the pilot turns the chopper  and flies away with scp-682 in pursuit  they make it back to the air force base  just ahead of scp-682  one of the agents jumps out of the  helicopter with the scp-1124  orb in his hands he races towards a  mobile containment chamber where he  places the orb at the far end before  turning to get out when he looks up  scp-682 is standing in the doorway its  chest heaves up and down its eyes are  wild the scp agent raises his gun and  fires  scp-682 snarls and leads into the  containment chamber the whole thing  shakes as the agent is torn apart his  gunshots and screams are silenced as the  door to the containment chamber shuts  the fiasco known as the grey dragon  incident is an embarrassment to the  foundation the o5 council has everyone  involved terminated  scp-682 is secured in a new containment  facility far away from  scp-1124 and the mysterious orbs are  placed in their own containment chamber  and hidden away from the world the  working hypothesis is that  scp-1124 are the eggs of scp-682  but further tests will need to be done  and since both of these scps are  extremely dangerous these experiments  might need to be conducted on a far away  planet perhaps it is time for the scp  foundation to revisit elena once again  let's just hope this time they don't  bring anything else back now watch  scp-682 waze scp foundation try to kill  hard to destroy reptile or check out how  to kill scp-682 theories and ideas for  more on the monster we all know and fear
 

